From 4f0260f50bd73c9e98e31d6e7c2050eb8c9538b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:41:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): lock the last unguarded GPU tests of the egui_app
 and lib binaries

Three headless tests of tests/egui_app.rs and three ignored pixel snapshot
tests made wgpu devices without gpu_guard. Put them under the guard and pin
the two sets in gpu_test_lock.

Fixes #3379

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
